# Phronesis Web Integration - Module 1: UI Foundation & Auth Architecture (Final Blueprint)

This is the comprehensive, engineering-grade blueprint for integrating the `phronesis-web` frontend with the `phronesis-platform` backend for Phase 1 (Identity & Authentication). 

We are adopting a pixel-perfect approach based on `PHRONESIS-BRAND-GUIDELINES` on the frontend, and we are strictly adhering to an **End-to-End Functional Strategy**—meaning there will be **no mock services**. Any backend endpoint required by the frontend that is currently missing or incomplete will be fully implemented in C# as part of this module.

