## 3. Comprehensive Routing Map

We will utilize Next.js App Router for strict role-based separation.

### Learner Portal
- **`/(auth)/learner/login/page.tsx`**: Learner Login Form.
- **`/(auth)/learner/register/page.tsx`**: Learner Registration.

### Guardian Portal
- **`/(auth)/guardian/login/page.tsx`**: Guardian Login Form.
- **`/(auth)/guardian/register/page.tsx`**: Guardian Registration.

### Teacher Portal
- **`/(auth)/teacher/login/page.tsx`**: Teacher Login Form.
- **`/(auth)/teacher/apply/page.tsx`**: Initial step for the Teacher application process.

### Staff/Admin Portal
- **`/(auth)/admin/login/page.tsx`**: Secure Staff/Admin Login gateway.

### Shared Authentication Routes
- **`/(auth)/shared/forgot-password/page.tsx`**: Input email to request a reset link.
- **`/(auth)/shared/reset-password/page.tsx`**: Input new password (requires token from URL).
- **`/(auth)/shared/verify-email/page.tsx`**: Display success/failure of email verification based on URL token.

