## 4. Data Flow & Field Mapping

All forms will use `react-hook-form` resolved by `zod` schemas that strictly map to the C# DTOs found in `Phronesis.Application`.

### 4.1 Registration Forms (`RegisterRequest.cs`)
- **Fields:** `FirstName`, `LastName`, `Email`, `Password`.
- **Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/register`
- **On Success:** Redirect to `/auth/shared/verify-email`.

### 4.2 Login Forms (`LoginRequest.cs`)
- **Fields:** `Email`, `Password`.
- **Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/login`
- **On Success:** Store `AccessToken` in memory (Zustand) and `RefreshToken` via HttpOnly cookies. Redirect to `/[role]/dashboard`.

### 4.3 Forgot & Reset Password (Fully Functional)
- **Forgot Password Fields:** `Email` -> Triggers backend email dispatch.
- **Reset Password Fields:** `NewPassword`, `ConfirmPassword` -> Sends payload + token to backend.

