## 5. Frontend Infrastructure & Security Core

### [NEW] `src/lib/api/axios.ts`
- **Request Interceptor:** Automatically attach the `AccessToken`.
- **Response Interceptor:** Detect `401 Unauthorized`. If triggered, automatically call `POST /api/v1/auth/refresh`.

### [NEW] `src/store/authStore.ts`
- A Zustand store configured with `persist` middleware.
- **State:** `user`, `accessToken`, `role`, `isAuthenticated`.

### [NEW] `src/middleware.ts`
- Next.js Edge Middleware protecting `/(learner)`, `/(guardian)`, `/(teacher)`, `/(admin)` route groups.

### [NEW] `src/components/ui/*`
- Build out the custom UI primitives (`Button`, `Input`, `PasswordStrengthMeter`) adhering to the brand guidelines.

